The default sort compares text. للأرقام المكتوبة كنص، use a numeric comparison:
```js
const items = ["10", "2", "1"];
const sorted = [...items].sort((a, b) => Number(a) - Number(b));
// ["1", "2", "10"]
```
The copy keeps your original array unchanged. This assumes every item represents a valid number.

Convert first، بعدين رتّب:
```js
const sorted = items.map(Number).sort((a, b) => a - b);
// [1, 2, 10]
```
Now the result contains numbers. القائمة الأصلية تبقى مثل ما هي.

